                <pb facs="0928" n="858" sameAs="frus:frus1883/pg858"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President of the Axar tribunal to Ali
                    Pasha.</hi></head>
                <p>The American physician insulted the director of tithes (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ashar maimour</hi>) and in tarmed hand, the zaptieh on duty in the
                    authorities’ mansion and the Sergeant Halii, while in the discharge of their
                    duties. He wounded the Sergeant Halil. Having confessed this offense during the
                    examination, he was imprisoned on that account, according to the report of the
                    judge of instruction. Having become sick in prison, he was taken to the hospital
                    upon a report to that effect.</p>
            </div>
